UEIPAC/UEIiDDS/MDS - MDS iDDS / CoreDX DDS runtime (ueimds-rootfs)
==================================================================

Copyright (C) MDS Aero Support Corporation
Copyright (C) Twin Oaks Computing, Inc.
Copyright (C) Jim Tcl authors

Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the LICENSES/
directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the prebuilt files
installed by ueimds-rootfs / ueimds-rootfs-dev. If this summary and a file
header disagree, the file header applies.

This package contains NO UEI code. It redistributes prebuilt third-party
binaries delivered to UEI in MDS/ship/target/ueipac.


